# Git Large File Storage (LFS) — track all pickle model files.
# GitHub blocks files > 100 MB. The Random Forest model files were 9-24 MB
# before the depth cap fix (depth capped at 10 in train_ml_track_ensemble.py).
# After the fix each RF model should be < 5 MB and does NOT need LFS.
# If model files grow beyond ~50 MB again, uncomment the lines below to
# re-enable LFS tracking.
#
# models/*.pkl filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# models/**/*.pkl filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
#
# For now, all .pkl files are committed directly as they are all under 25 MB.
